@startuml
title Hospital Client and Frontend Deployment

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 70

node "Hospital Client Device" as Client <<device>> {
    node "Web Browser" as Browser <<execution environment>> {
        artifact "Registration App" as RegApp
        artifact "Monitor App" as MonitorApp
    }
}

node "Cloud Static Hosting" as StaticHosting {
    artifact "Registration App\nProduction Build" as RegBuild
    artifact "Monitor App\nProduction Build" as MonitorBuild
}

node "FastAPI Backend\nWeb Service" as Backend

StaticHosting --> Browser : HTTPS\nApplication files

RegApp --> Backend : HTTPS / JSON
MonitorApp --> Backend : HTTPS / JSON

Backend --> RegApp : WSS\nLive updates
Backend --> MonitorApp : WSS\nLive updates

note bottom of Browser
The applications execute in the browser
after their production files are loaded.
end note

@enduml